{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Classic Story RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone. Only the Digital Afterlife remains, silent for a thousand years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Until now.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/8178bde5fcd81ae5ced87c92fbce4cdf.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/8178bde5fcd81ae5ced87c92fbce4cdf.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/8178bde5fcd81ae5ced87c92fbce4cdf.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u00a0<br>Nocturne\u2019s rich narrative will leave you questioning what it means to be alive, while you traverse a beautiful world that\u2019s falling apart around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100,000+ word story.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >101 playable tracks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ hour campaign.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythm Combat for all Skill Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturne features an entirely skill based rhythm combat system.<br>With six difficulty options, Nocturne is suitable for beginners and veterans of the rhythm genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a huge variety of enemies and bosses with unique mechanics and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks to land critical hits, but miss too many notes and enemies will attack you back.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/beb3711fb90c0d2c21ffda3686bf978e.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/beb3711fb90c0d2c21ffda3686bf978e.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/beb3711fb90c0d2c21ffda3686bf978e.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full RPG Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturne features all the traditional RPG systems, from leveling and stats, to items, equipment, shops, cutscenes, bosses, exploration, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b8f78406ce1ba4861241f44cab3f86aa.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b8f78406ce1ba4861241f44cab3f86aa.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b8f78406ce1ba4861241f44cab3f86aa.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat enemies to unlock them in Arcade Mode, where you can replay any of Nocturne\u2019s 101 original tracks, and go for new highscores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Orchestral Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All boss music was recorded live by the Slovak National Symphony Orchestra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an entirely skill based rhythm combat system with 101 playable tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unusual characters who'll challenge what it means to be alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and beautiful pixel art world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from six difficulty modes suitable for beginners and veterans of the rhythm genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up from equipment, levels, shops, bosses, exploration, secrets and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an original soundtrack with live orchestral performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your highscores in Arcade mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a giant orange fish.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1374860?t=1763851471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1374860?t=1763851471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/16a68851c20bce42525409495afa4cc29d82d123/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763851471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/16a68851c20bc