1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Orchestral Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All boss music was recorded live by the Slovak National Symphony Orchestra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.poster.avif?t=1763851471\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.webm?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.mp4?t=1763851471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an entirely skill based rhythm combat system with 101 playable tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unusual characters who'll challenge what it means to be alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and beautiful pixel art world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from six difficulty modes suitable for beginners and veterans of the rhythm genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up from equipment, levels, shops, bosses, exploration, secrets and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an original soundtrack with live orchestral performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your highscores in Arcade mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a giant orange fish.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pracy Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_im